cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Light-Prover, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "Light-Prover"
abstract: >-
  Light-Prover is a toolkit for sound verification of Lean 4 proofs.
  It checks a whole project against a pinned challenge: every target statement,
  every axiom and every declaration is re-checked by the official Lean kernel
  and by an independent second kernel, while an untrusted fast build, a native
  exporter and a parallel kernel replay reduce the time, memory and edit-loop
  turnaround of the verification.
authors:
  - name: "Light-Prover contributors"
version: "0.1.0"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - theorem proving
  - proof verification
  - formal verification
  - proof checking
